*
!host/
!entrypoint.sh
!.cache-bust
# Whitelist the context-mode plugin manifest so the Dockerfile can read
# the pinned version at build time (codeflare#309). Each parent directory
# must be un-ignored explicitly because un-ignore does not recurse upward.
!preseed/
!preseed/agents/
!preseed/agents/claude/
!preseed/agents/claude/plugins/
!preseed/agents/claude/plugins/context-mode/
!preseed/agents/claude/plugins/context-mode/.claude-plugin/
!preseed/agents/claude/plugins/context-mode/.claude-plugin/plugin.json
# REQ-STOR-017/AD90: un-ignore the committed agent seed + materialize script so the
# Dockerfile can bake the agent-config tree into the image for the Governed Mode
# delta-sync lay-down. NOTE: a negated directory (`!src/`) re-includes its whole
# subtree in the build CONTEXT (same idiom as `!preseed/` above) — only the two files
# the Dockerfile actually COPYs land in the image; the rest is benign context bloat,
# not a leak. Each parent dir is listed because un-ignore does not recurse upward.
!src/
!src/lib/
!src/lib/agent-seed.generated.ts
!scripts/
!scripts/materialize-agent-seed.mjs
